# DVC fingerprints the exact bytes of its inputs (data_pipeline/, config/) and of the
# reports kept in Git. Git would otherwise give Windows checkouts CRLF line
# endings, so `dvc status` would call unchanged files modified and `dvc repro`
# would redo the whole run. Text is always checked out with LF, on every system.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.zip binary
